WEBVTT

00:00:00.513 --> 00:00:02.033
<b>I can</b> park here.

00:00:05.079 --> 00:00:06.686
<b>I can’t</b> park there.

00:00:09.747 --> 00:00:11.160
<b>You can</b> sit here.

00:00:14.206 --> 00:00:15.719
You <b>can’t sit</b> there.

00:00:18.831 --> 00:00:20.216
<b>He can</b> help us.

00:00:23.272 --> 00:00:24.785
<b>He can’t</b> help us.

00:00:27.840 --> 00:00:29.932
<b>We can</b> have lunch outside.

00:00:33.229 --> 00:00:35.663
<b>We can’t</b> have lunch outside.

00:00:38.685 --> 00:00:40.625
<b>They can</b> come to dinner tonight.

00:00:43.725 --> 00:00:45.725
<b>They can’t</b> come to dinner tonight.

00:00:48.737 --> 00:00:50.090
<b>Can I</b> park here?

00:00:53.147 --> 00:00:54.405
Yes, <b>you can.</b>

00:00:57.499 --> 00:00:58.900
No, <b>you can’t.</b>

00:01:01.955 --> 00:01:03.135
<b>Can he</b> help us?

00:01:06.201 --> 00:01:07.657
Yes, <b>he can</b>.

00:01:10.686 --> 00:01:12.220
No, <b>he can’t.</b>

00:01:15.297 --> 00:01:17.225
<b>Can they</b> come to dinner tonight?

00:01:20.293 --> 00:01:21.672
Yes, <b>they can</b>.

00:01:24.751 --> 00:01:26.067
No, <b>they can’t</b>.